silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_01_microchip_identifies_concrete_anchors#householdchipregistry silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdChipRegistry is the household local registry record under file 77 binding chip 9000-0000-0042 and chip 9000-0000-0099 to the household account at 77 Maple Street. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ChipRegistry77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
